      "type": "mcq",
      "question": "Mathematics _____ my favorite subject.",
      "question_hi": "गणित मेरा पसंदीदा विषय _____। (Mathematics _____ my favorite subject.)",
      "question_gu": "ગણિત મારો મનપસંદ વિષય _____ છે. (Mathematics _____ my favorite subject.)",
      "options": ["is", "are", "were", "have"],
      "options_hi": ["is", "are", "were", "have"],
      "options_gu": ["is", "are", "were", "have"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "Subjects ending in -s are singular (like Mathematics, Physics, News).",
      "explanation_hi": "-s पर समाप्त होने वाले विषय एकवचन होते हैं (जैसे Mathematics, Physics, News)।",
      "explanation_gu": "-s પર સમાપ્ત થતા વિષયો એકવચન હોય છે (જેમ કે Mathematics, Physics, News)."
    },
