      "type": "mcq",
      "question": "The police _____ caught the thief.",
      "question_hi": "पुलिस ने चोर को पकड़ लिया _____। (The police _____ caught the thief.)",
      "question_gu": "પોલીસે ચોરને પકડી લીધો _____ છે. (The police _____ caught the thief.)",
      "options": ["has", "have", "is", "was"],
      "options_hi": ["has", "have", "is", "was"],
      "options_gu": ["has", "have", "is", "was"],
      "correct_index": 1,
      "explanation": "The word 'police' is always treated as plural.",
      "explanation_hi": "'police' शब्द को हमेशा बहुवचन माना जाता है।",
